**Environmental Impact of Sustainable Investing:**
Sustainable investing has a significant impact on the environment, with the potential to reduce greenhouse gas emissions by 78% by 2050 (IRENA, 2020). Companies with high sustainability ratings have reduced their greenhouse gas emissions by an average of 50% since 2010 (Patagonia, 2022). Sustainable investing can also promote sustainable agriculture, reduce water pollution, and protect biodiversity.

